<%# locals: (count:) %>
<%# The number of unread notifications, inside the "Ungelesen" pill of the list
    head. Its own id, so that every state change can replace it by stream
    (update, mark_all_read, archive_all). Empty at zero: the pill then says
    the word alone. %>
<span id="inbox_unread_count" class="people-pill__count"><%= count if count.to_i.positive? %></span>
